# Fact-checking Donald Trump's speech at the 2020 Republican National Convention
## "Last month, I took on Big Pharma. You think that is easy? I signed orders that would massively lower the cost of your prescription drugs."
Misleading. {"articleBody":"\"Joe Biden claims he has empathy for the vulnerable, yet the party he leads supports the extreme late-term abortion of defenseless babies right up to the moment of birth.\" \"When asked if he supports cutting police funding, Joe Biden replied, ‘Yes, absolutely.’\" Biden replied: \"Yes. Absolutely.\" \"Biden has promised to abolish the production of American oil, coal, shale, and natural gas – laying waste to the economies of Pennsylvania, Ohio, Texas, North Dakota, Oklahoma, Colorado, and New Mexico.\" This is misleading. \"Biden also vowed to oppose school choice and close down charter schools, ripping away the ladder of opportunity for Black and Hispanic children.\" This is Mostly False. \"Joe Biden recently raised his hand on the debate stage and promised he was going to give it away, your health care dollars to illegal immigrants, which is going to bring massive number of immigrants into our country.\" Biden \"has pledged a $4 trillion tax hike on almost all American families.\" Yes and no. \"Biden voted for the NAFTA disaster, the single worst trade deal ever enacted; he supported China's entry into the World Trade Organization, one of the greatest economic disasters of all time. After those Biden calamities, the United States lost 1 in 4 manufacturing jobs.\" The Obama-Biden administration \"spied on my campaign and they got caught.\" False. Democrats \"will demolish the suburbs.\" \"The top 10 most dangerous cities in the country are run by Democrats, and have been for many decades.\" This is misleading. \"During the Democrat Convention, the words ‘under God’ were removed from the Pledge of Allegiance — not once, but twice.\" \"We have already built 300 miles of border wall.\" This is wrong. \"By the end of my first term, we will have approved more than 300 federal judges, including two great new Supreme Court justices.\" \"When the anarchists started ripping down our statues and monuments, right outside, I signed an order immediately, 10 years in prison.\" \"We have spent nearly $2.5 trillion on completely rebuilding our military, which was very badly depleted when I took office.\" This is Mostly False. \"Last month, I took on Big Pharma. You think that is easy? I signed orders that would massively lower the cost of your prescription drugs.\" Misleading. \"We will always and very strongly protect patients with preexisting conditions, and that is a pledge from the entire Republican Party.\" \"Over the past three months, we have gained over 9 million jobs, a new record.\" \"The United States has among the lowest (COVID-19) case fatality rates of any major country in the world. The European Union's case fatality rate is nearly three times higher than ours.\" \"We will produce a vaccine before the end of the year, or maybe even sooner.\" Anthony Fauci said. \"We developed, from scratch, the largest and most advanced testing system in the world.\""}
